# SLOServe

Before coding, read `AGENTS.md` and the matching skill in `SKILLS.md`.

## Non-negotiables

- Current phase is Week 1 until harness + mock server deliverable exists.
- No custom scheduler until Gate 1 (interference proven).
- No gateway, K8s, Grafana, or CUDA until interference graph exists.
- No GPU rental until Week 1 works offline.
- Compare vs FCFS, priority, and chunked prefill — not naive FCFS alone.
- One experimental variable at a time (Week 5).

## Week 1 focus

Streaming client that records: request class, arrival, first token, every token time, completion. Workloads + metrics + mock server. One command → metrics file without GPU.

## If asked to jump ahead

State the active week, the gate that blocks later work, and do only the current deliverable.
